{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120426","id":3895679619,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7oM1qD","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120426","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120426.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120426.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120426","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120426/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120426/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120426/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b60bd4a38461212a9e7b56ab4cf172001ad89b11","number":120426,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"renderer: Collapse resource tracker/usage vectors into `TrackedResource`","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"# Summary\r\n\r\nReplace the in-sync command_trackers/command_tracker_usages and `UniformSet::draw_trackers/draw_trackers_usage` vector pairs with a single `TrackedResource { tracker, usage }` vector, and update the graph usage APIs (`add_*_usages`, `add_driver_callback`, `_add_command_to_graph`) accordingly.\r\n\r\nAnother benefit, given both vectors were read at the same time, is that the pair of values will be in contiguous locations in memory. Not likely to move any benchmark needles, but it is still an improvement.\r\n\r\n# Motivation\r\n\r\nI have been exploring an alternative synchronisation mechanism for Metal to use fences, which may track pipeline / render stages as a 3<sup>rd</sup> array. By introducing `TrackedResource`, I will be able to add the field to this rather than manage another vector that must be kept in sync.\r\n\r\n----\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>🤖 AI disclosure</summary>\r\n\r\nI used 🤖 to migrate my implementation from my long-running development branch to this branch. I wrote the code.\r\n\r\n</summary>","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-06-19T02:20:13Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T11:21:14Z","closed_at":"2026-08-24T23:24:25Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"58069209dff35e97d93191b652b3b0ae6c69d87f","assignee":null,"ass